		isCombat = true,
		starEffectDesc = "In the first round of entering the field, reduce the rage of all enemies by 200 points, and disregards all buff effect of enemy target's during attack",
		describe = [[
#L10#Delta Stream:#L0#Increasing all allies'#C0x5c9970#$(6+skillLevel*0.06-0.06)$%#C0x5B545B#SP. ATK and#C0x5c9970#$(6+skillLevel*0.06-0.06)$%#C0x5B545B#P.ATK；Increasing 10% own critical hit rate and blood draining quality,  and critical hit rate of surrounding units by 5%
#F20#
#F40##L10#Breaking Swipe:#L0#The target of Rayquaza attack can only defend with 50% of the lower of its P.DEF and SP.DEF (And attack can ignore SP. DMG immunity)
#F20#
#F40##L10#Anger touched:#L0#Getting 2 [Rage] when enters,  2 [Rage] when own active attacks,  1 [Rage] on the active skill attacks of allies,  1 [Rage] when critical hits. Each Rage increases 3% DMG bonus and 2% critical hit DMG. After reaching 7  [Rage] ,  it removes all non-dominant control effects and immediately releases the special ultimate skill,   [Max Dragon Ascent] and then  [Flying into the clouds] ,  appears before next round and add [Wind Shield] for 2 rounds(2 triggers for the whole battle),  
#F10#
#F40#[#L10#Flying into the clouds#L0#] Rushing itself into the clouds(Unable to be attacked and damaged by skill effect )]],
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		skillType2 = 3,
		zawakeSimpleDesc = "#C0x5c9970#When there is 2 or more Dragon Type allies, get 3 [Rage] when enters,[Flying into the clouds]+1; When [Flying into the clouds], allies actively attacking, Mega Rayquaza can use basic attacks to assist. When Dragon/ Fly Type Pokemon actively attack ,Mega Rayquaza can trigger the effect of basic skill (each time [Flying into the cloud] can only trigger assist attack 5 time); Delta Stream Buff : Increases 10% Crit rate for Dragon Type Pokemon. Ignores targets  P.DEF&SP.DEF for 20%. And obtains [Wind Shield] for 2 rounds when entering the battlefield for the first time(Yveltal will get [Wind Shield] when it breaks the cocoon )",
		changeUnitTrigger = true,
		skillName = "Delta Current",
		zawakeEffectDesc = [[
#L10#Delta Stream: #L0#Increases all allies'#C0x5c9970#$(6+skillLevel*0.06-0.06)$%#C0x5B545B#SP. ATK and#C0x5c9970#$(6+skillLevel*0.06-0.06)$%#C0x5B545B#P.ATK; Increases 10% own Crit rate and Lifesteal, and increases Crit rate of surrounding units by 5%. Increases 10% Crit rate for Dragon-Type Ally. Ignores targets' P.DEF&SP.DEF by 20% when Dragon-Type allies trigger Crit. Grants Fly-Type Ally [Wind Shield] for 2 rounds when entering the battlefield for the first time and increases their SPD by 10%. (Yveltal will get [Wind Shield] when the cocoon breaks)
#F20#
#F40##L10#Breaking Swipe: #L0#The attack target of Rayquaza can only apply with 50% of the lower one of its P&SP.DEF for defense (Attack also ignore SP. DMG immunity)
#F20#
#F40##L10#Anger touched: #L0#Gets 2 [Rage] when enters the battle, 2 [Rage] when own active attacks (If there is 2 or more Dragon-Type allies, get 3 [Rage] when enters the battle. [Flying into the clouds] cap+1) 
#F20#
#F40#Gets 1 [Rage] on the active skill attacks of allies, 1 [Rage] when critical hits. Each Rage increases 3% DMG bonus and 2% Crit DMG. When reaching 7 [Rage], removes all non-dominant control effects and immediately releases the special ultimate skill, [Max Dragon Ascent], and then [Flying into the clouds]
#F20#
#F40#During [Flying into the clouds], Mega Rayquaza can use basic attack to assist after allies active attacks. When Dragon/Fly-Type allies actively attack, Mega Rayquaza's assist attacks trigger the effect of basic attack (each [Flying into the cloud] can only trigger assist attack up to 5 time). Mega Rayquaza fly back to the battlefield before own next move and get [Wind Shield] for 2 rounds (triggers up to 2 times during the whole battle) 
#F10#
#F40# [#L10#Flying into the clouds#L0#] Rushing into the clouds (Unable to be attacked and damaged by skill effect)]],
