	[19736] = {
		zawakeSimpleType = 1,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		starEffectDesc = "When [Molten Core] is activated, gain Lava State for 2 rounds and 30% Crit Resistance permanently, immune to Max HP reduction effect, the damage of Desolate Land and Lava armor increased by 30%",
		zawakeEffectDesc = [[
#C0xC0C0C0#Where am I is the earth!#C0x5B545B#
#F10#
#F40##L10#Desolate Land:#L0#Disturbing the power of the earth, deal #C0xE69900##C0x5c9970#$(20+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B#P.ATK#C0x5B545B#True DMG to all enemies, and inflict [Lava Burn] for 2 rounds ([Lava Burn]:Debuff, target takes Fire Elemental DMG equal to 40% of the Primal Groudon's P.ATK before each round, can not be stacked); Each time Primal Groudon triggers Earthquake effect: increase the Earthquake damage ratio by 15% up to 150%. Increases the Lava Burn damage ratio by 10% up to 100% (For each Fire/Ground Type ally, the Earthquake damage ratio&Lava Burn damage ratio increase by an additional 10%); With [Blind] effect: reduce all enemies Hit Rate at the begining. Each time Primal Groudon triggers Earthquake effect, the [Blind] effect ratio of two enemies is reduced by 5% up to 10%.
#F20#
#F40# In the first 5 big rounds, Fire Type/Earth Type allies will trigger an addtional 60% DMG [Desolate Land] effect after active attack. 
#F20#
#F40##L10#Magma Armor:#L0#After Primal Reversion, Primal Groudon's body is covered with lava:self-immune to Freeze; self-immune to displacement control like Whirlwind etc. Enemies attack Groudon will get 80% of its P.ATK Fire Elemental re-damage(for each Fire Type/Earth Type ally,+20% Fire re-damage ratio) and make Fire Type/Earth Type allies behind Primal Groudon get half of the Fire re-damage effect; [Magma Armor] increases 500% P.DEF&SP.DEF at the begining. And reduce 60% for each round, down to 200%(the first 3 rounds can not be ignored), and increase 20% final DMG reduction when facing non-attribute active skill attacks.
#F20#
#F40##L10#Molten Core:#L0# The DMG dealt by Desolate Land and Magma Armor will be absorbed and stored by Molten Core. When Primal Groudon takes lethal DMG, it retains 1 HP and activate#L10#Molten Core#L0#. When get attacked, priority Consumption the energy of #L10#Molten Core#L0#. Energy can not be recovered and will not take excessive DMG when it is exhausted,and the same amount of Rage will be recovered by consuming energy.#L10#Molten Core#L0# The maximum DMG absorption amount does not exceed 2 times of Primal Groudon's maximum HP,When Molten Core is activated, inflict [Earth Seal] to all enemies for 2 rounds. If triggerd [Molten Core] when the P.DEF&SP.DEF boosed by the [Magma Armor] is not lowered to the MIN, at leat 50% of its own HP will be retained in the [Molten Core] energy.
